11	/**
12	 * Marketing Hub — Studio / Assets / Calendar server actions.
13	 *
14	 * Every export re-checks requireArea("platform"). HARD GUARDRAILS:
15	 *  - NOTHING here posts to Instagram/Meta/Reddit/X or sends anything. Channel
16	 *    "Connect" is a bookkeeping stub (connected stays false; no network).
17	 *  - The stored SVG is ALWAYS re-rendered server-side from the trusted template
18	 *    + field values — never accepted verbatim from the client — so a creative
19	 *    can never smuggle arbitrary markup into the DB.
20	 *  - Rasterization to PNG happens in the browser (canvas); the server only ever
21	 *    deals in the SVG text + params.
22	 */
