55	/* ================================================================== *
56	 * H6. Any customer who enables 2FA is permanently locked out
57	 *
58	 * The login email input was UNCONTROLLED while the password beside it was
59	 * controlled. React 19 resets uncontrolled fields after a form action settles,
60	 * and the 2FA path submits the SAME form twice: pass 1 returns `needs2fa`, pass
61	 * 2 must re-send email + password + code. React blanked the email between them,
62	 * `credsSchema` rejected the empty string, and the reply was a bare "Invalid
63	 * email or password." with no `needs2fa` — which unmounted the code field. With
64	 * correct credentials, there was no way through. Ever.
65	 * ================================================================== */
